  "html": "<div id=\"question-218619\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">5.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/249#14738\">Applying Properties of Tautologies and Contradictions</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"218619\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>If <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"127\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a statement, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42D TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">t</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a tautology, and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"129\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is a contradiction, complete the following table of logical equivalences.</p>\n</div><div id=\"questionBody-218619\" class=\"questionBody\">\n<p></p><table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">Statement</td>\n    <td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">Is Logically Equivalent To</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n    <td align=\"center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"183\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42D TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2227\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-b\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">t</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n    <td align=\"center\"><div id=\"selectList-218619-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px -2px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-218619-0\" style=\"width: 43px; height: 22px; line-height: 22px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"25\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D41C TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">c</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 22px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"25\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; positio